<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Romah</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROMAHEA veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romah</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROMAHEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Romah cauk cun Pawluh naw Romaha veki sangcim veia a cehnak vaia mawng a yuka kyaki. Ania ngaih ta jumeikiea ksunga khut bi lü, Spain da cehnak üng jumeikie naw ami kpüi vaia phäha kyaki. Ania ksing Khritjan jumeinak ja akcanga Khritjan vecawh ning a yuka kyaki. Romah cauk üng Pawluha pyen hlü ktung avan cun veki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Romaha veki sangcim jah hnukset päng lü a jah ktaiyü peta mawng cun a jah mtheha ca a yuk üng aktung bawk ta “Thangkdaw cun naw ihawkba Pamhnam naw khyange amät üng a jah ngsunpyunsak, acun hin akcük üngkhyüh apäihnak cäpa jumnak üng kyaki” (1.17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawluh naw a yuka mawng a mdäm law. Khyang nghngicim avan, Judahe ja khyangmjükcee avan, Pamhnam üng ngsungpyun vai hlüki, isetiüngta khyang avan cun mkhyekatnak k'uma vea phäha kyaki. Jesuh jumnak phäha khyang cun Pamhnam naw amät üng ngsungpyunnak a jah pet. Pawluh naw a yuk be tü cun Khritaw am xüngnak kthai cun naw Pamhnam üng akthaia jah phungeisaki. Jumeikie cun Pamhnam üng dimyenak ja Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya ngcim a mkhyekatnak ja thihnak üng lätnak jah peki. Akyang kdäm 5-8 üng Pawluh naw a yuk cun Pamhnama thum ja mkhyangcima johit cun jumeikiea xünnak üng veki tia pyenki. Acun päng lü khyang avana phäha Pamhnama nümyannak üng ihawkba Judahea ja Khyangmjükcea phäh pi kyaki ni ti cun pyenki. Judahe naw Jesuh am ami doei cun khyang avan Pamhnama bäkhäknak k'uma pha law khaie Pamhnama mlungaih ja Judahe naw Jesuh cun dokhamei khaie ti cun ami juma kyaki. Ihawkba Khritjan ngneingnawng üng xün vai, aktunga jawngengnak üng püipaw am vecawh vai ti cun apäihnaka Pawluh naw yuki. Pamhnama phäh ihawkba bilawh vai, mat ja mat Khritjan ning üng vecawh vai ja mät ja mät ksingeinak ngthähnake Pawluh naw yuki. Kca a yuk cun amäta ngthu ja Pamhnam mhlünmtainak ngthu üng päihsaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma ja luyüi (1:1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khyang üng hlükia küikyannak (1:18—3:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pamhnama küikyannaka tuilam (3:21—4:25)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khritaw am xünnak kthai (5:1—8:39)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pamhnama nüm’yannak k'uma Isarele (9:1—11:36)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjan vecawh ning (12:1—15:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Apäihnak ja Pawluha ümhlamnak (15:14—16:27)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Jesuh Khritawa mpya ja ngsä vaia khü, Pamhnama thangkdaw sang khaia xüa Pawluh üngkhyüh ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Cangcim üng ang’yuka kba thangkdaw cun ajana Pamhnam naw sahmae veia khyütam a jah peta kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Pumsa lama Davita mjü üngkhyüh hmi lawki, a capa, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa mawng, thihnak üngkhyüh a thawhnak be cun naw a johit dämduhki Pamhnama Cakpa üngka ngcimcaihnak mdanki. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Ani üngka Pamhnam naw kei cun Jesuha phäha ngsäa kya lü khyangmjü avan naw jum lü kcangnak vaia lam jah msüm khaia kcün kdaw a na peta kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Ahin cun nangmi Romahe Pamhnam naw Jesuh Khritaw üng a ning jah ka vaia a ning jah khüa kyaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Romah mlüh üng Pa Pamhnama mhläkphyanak ja, ngcimcaih khaia jah khüe naküta veia:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="ROM 1:7">Mi Pamhnam ja Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa veia ka bäkhäknak ja dim’yenak be se.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jenak mtheh lü ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Nami jumnak khawmdek avan üng ngthang hükia kyase, nangmia phäha, Jesuh Khritawa ngming üng akcüka, Pamhnam ka jenaki.<verse eid="ROM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Nami phäha angläta ka ktaiyüki, a Cakpaa thangkdaw sangkhap lü, a khut ka mlungkyawng avan am ka bi hin ka juma Pamhnam cun saksi ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Pamhnam naw a hlükawei ta nami veia ka lawnak hlawt vaia ngläta ka ktaiyüki. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Aktäa ning jah hmu hlü veng. Isetiakyaküng nami khängceknak vaia ngmüimkhya dawkyanak ka ning jah teyet hlüa phäh ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Ka ti hlü ta, nami jumnak ja ka jumnak am ngjuktha mi ngpetei vai ka ti hlünaka kyaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ka püie, nami veia ka law vaia ka ngtün üngpi am ka law vaia na khamki veki ni. Khyangmjükcee ami ngthunghlaia kba, nangmi pi nami ngthunghlai vaia ka hlüeia kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Kei hin Krike ja khyang kceea pi kyase, khyang ngmawnge ja akthemea pi kyase; khyangmjü naküta phäha ka mta veki. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Acunakyase, Romaha nami vekiea veia pi thangkdaw pyen khaia ka yüki ni.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thangkdawa johit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mk 8:38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Thangkdaw cun Pamhnama johita kyase jumeikie naküta phäh küikyannaka kyaki tia ka üpeiki. Akcüka Judahe phäha kya lü, acunkäna khyangmjükceea phäha kyaki tia ksing lü thangkdaw cun kei naw am hmaisetei na veng.<verse eid="ROM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:4">Heb 2:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Thangkdaw cun ngdang lü ihawkba Pamhnam naw amät am jah ngsungpyunsaki ti cun jumeinak üng ni tüneinak üngkhyüh akpäihnak vei cäpa a kyak ve. Cangcim naw a pyena akba, “A jumnaka phäh Pamhnam naw a angsungpyunsaka khyang cun xüng khai.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jumeinak üngkhyüh Pamhnam üng ngsungpyunnak yahki cun xüng khai, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jumeinak üngkhyüh Pamhnam üng ngsunpyunsak xüng khai.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nghngicima mkhyekatnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Ngthu kcang ksingnak vai jah sungkhamkie khyang ksee jah mkhyenakea phäh Pamhnama mlungsonak cun khankhaw üngkhyüh ngdang lawki. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw mkhyekatnak thungki, isetiakyaküng, amimi naw Pamhnam ami ksing vai jäki ni. Pamhnam amät kung naw a jäsak ni. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Pamhnam naw khawmdek a tüipyan üng am hmuh theia a khyaihnak, angsäia johit ja Pamhnama a kyaknak cun a tüipyange üng ngsingteeiki ni. Acunakyase, acuna khyange naw ami lätnak vai am pyen thei u. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17">Eph 4:17</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 4:18">18</ref></char></note>Pamhnam ksing u lü pi am mhlünmtai u; jenak pi am pyen u; am ngtähkia cungai u se, ami mlungkyawng axawn cun nghmüp am beki. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Akthemea ngaieikie cunsepi angkie, <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Deut 4:16-18</ref></char></note>Am thi theikia Pamhnam cun am hjawhkhah u lü, Pamhnama nghnün üng thi theikia nghngicime, khae, khisae ja mcea ngvak hükiea mäih juktuh pyang u lü sawhkhahkie.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnam naw ami mlung hlüa aksekhyue ja ngkekhyakeinak cun mat ja mata khana bilawh vaia a jah pet. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Pamhnama ngthu kcang cun hleihlaka nglatsak u lü, mhnünmcengki jum vaia hnün üng a mhnünmcenga ksai hjawkhah u lü mküimtokie. Mhnünmcengki cun angläta mküimto vai ni. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Isetiakyaküng ahin ami bi cun Pamhnam naw ngkekhyakei phyakia hüipawmnak a jah peta phäha ni. Nghnumie naw pi nglawi khaia venak vaia ami ngtüipüi cun am nglawi khaia nglat lü vecawhnakie. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Kpami he naw pi nghnumi nglawikia ami ihawm püi vai cun hawih u lü, am dawkia hüipawmnaka mlungmthin am kpami ja kpami am nglawi khaia ipawm u lü, acuna phäh mkhuimkhanak amimät naw amimäta khana pha law khaia bilokie.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Acunüng, Pamhnam ami ksing vai am ngaikiea kyase, am nglawiki pawh khaiea, am dawkia mlungmthin ta khaiea, Pamhnam naw jah hawihin se, <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>am ngsungpyunnak, mkhyekatnak, kamvanak, ngneingnawng am dawnak naküt am be lawki he; khyang hnimnak, ngvawknak, hleihlaknak, am dawkia vecawhnak am be u lü; am dawkia khyang pyeneikie, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>khyang am mpyeneikia khyange, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leisawngnak am taki cun Pamhnam naw cawkeiki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnam naw cawkeiki, lü leisawngnak am taki.</char></note> Pamhnam hnengkia khyange, khyang mlungso, kyäp säihkia ngaikia khyange, awcahkia khyange, mkhyekatnak akthai mtüikia khyange, nupaa pyen am cungaikia khyange, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>mät naw mät ksingnak am takia khyange, ami pyena kba am vekie, mhläkphyanak am ngtüipüikia khyange, mpyeneinak am takia khyanga kya lawki he; <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>acuna ngkhaw jah pawhmsahkie naküt cun, thi khai kunga kyaki ni tia Pamhnama thuma pyen cun ksingkie. Amimät däka am kyase, khyang kce acukba pawhmsah khawikiea khana pi aktäa jekie.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mt 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Lk 6:37</ref></char>
    </note>Ka püi aw, khyang kce ngthu na mkhyahki aw. Aua na kyak üngpi, na pyen vai i am ve. Khyang kcea lei na mkhyah üng ami bilawh akba bi hnga lü na mät naw na mät pi na mkateiki. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Acukba vekiea khana, Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnak cun ngthu kcanga kyaki tia mi ksingki. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Ka püi aw, acukba vekie na jah mkhyah peki, namät pi acun kba na ve hngakia kyase, Pamhnama ngthumkhyahnak üng na lät khaia na ngaiki aw.<verse eid="ROM 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Am ani üng Pamhnama dämduhkia mpyeneinak ja cuneinak ja mlungsaünak cun am hnaläüeiki. Pamhnam cun dawki tia akcanga na ksingki, isetiakyaküng, ngjutnak na yah be khaia lam ni msümki ni. <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Na mlung ngcang lü pyen nami mhlihki acunakyase Pamhnam mlungsonak ja ngsungpyunki ngthumkhyahnaka Mhnüp üng däm bawk khaia nami bilawh cun naw mdan law khai. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sal 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Ngthk 24:12</ref></char></note>Khyang avan mi bilawh akba Pamhnam naw jah thung be khai. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Akdaw pawh lü, hlüngtainak, mhlünmtainak ja, am thi theikia xünak suikie am, acune üng Pamhnam naw anglät xünak ja pe khai. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Am dawki ami läknak vaia, cangki mah u lü, amimäta dawnak suikiea khana Pamhnama mlungsonak pha lawki.<verse eid="ROM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Mkhyekatnak pawhkiea khana khuikhanak ja msawhleinak ve law khai, akcüka Judahe, cun päng lü khyangmjükcee khana pha law khai. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Cunsepi, Pamhnam naw akdaw pawhmsahkie naküta khana hlüngtainak, mhlünmtainak ja dim’yenak jah pe khai, akcüka Judahe üng jah pe lü acun käna, khyangmjükcee üng jah pe khai. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Deut 10:17</ref></char></note>Isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw khyang avana khana angteha ngthumkhyah khai.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Khyangmjükcee naw Mosia thum am ta u, amimi cun thum kaa mkhyekat u lü khyükie. Judahe cun thum takie, ami mkhyekatnak cun thum am ngthumkhyah khamei khaie. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Thum ngjaknak sawxat am Pamhnam üng ngsungpyun bea am kya lü Thuma hlüei bilawhnak üng ni a kya. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Khyangmjükcee naw Thum am ta u, amimäta ngaiha thum ami läk üng, Thum am ksing u lüpi amimäta ngaihnak ami läka kyase, acun cun ami phäha thuma kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Ami mlung k'uma thum veki ti cun ami ngneingnawng naw mdanki. Amimäta ksingnak naw kcangki tia mdan lü ami cungaihnak naw ahüt üng jah mkatei lü ahüt üng jah mhlätki. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Acuna Mhnüp üng, ka sanga Thangkdawa mäiha Pamhnam naw Jesuh khritaw am, khyange naw ampyua ami ngaihnake naküt cun ngthumkhyah law khai.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judahe ja Thum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Nangmi üng avang naw namimät naw Judah khyang tia nami ngsuieiki. Thuma khana ngdüi u lü Pamhnam üng nami awhcahkie. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Pamhnam naw a ning pawh hlüsak na ksingki, akdaw xü vaia mawng Thum üng na ngthei pängki; <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>amikmüe jah ngkhahpüi lü nghmüp üng vekiea phäha akvaia na kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Anghmawnge ja akxawie jah mtheikia na kyaki. Nang cun Thum ksingnak ja ngthungtak ksingnak na taki tia ngsingki. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Khyang kce na mtheiki naw ise namät am na ngtheiki ni. Khyanga ka mpyuk am daw tia pyen lü, namät na mpyuki aw. <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Khyanga khyu käh bäühmanak vai ti lü namät naw na jah bäühma na hüki aw. Juktuh he jah msetei lü, temple k'uma na mpyueiki aw. <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Pamhnama Thum ka taki ti lü awcah na lü, thum lümkan lü, Pamhnama thang na setsaki aw. <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Hesa 52:5</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Cangcim üng a ng’yuka kba, “Nangmi Judahe ning jah hmu u lü Pamhnama ngming khyangmjükcee naw mseteikie.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Thum na läkia a kyaküng, vunmawih cun phumah lü thum am na läk üngta vun na mawih cun am mawih üng ni a täng be. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Acunakyase, vun am mawiki khyangmjükce naw thum a läk üng vun am a mawih pi a mawiha Pamhnam naw am jah ngai khai aw. <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Acunüng, Thum am na läka phäha ca yu lü vun mawiki lüpi khyangmjükcee naw nangmi Judahe ning jah mkatei khaie, isetiakyaküng ami vun am mawi u lüpi Thum ami läka phäh kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Akpung däka Judah khyanga kyanak cun Judah kcanga kyanaka am ni. Akpung däka vun mawihnak cun vun mawihnak kcanga am kya. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Deut 30:6</ref></char></note>Cunsepi, ak'uma Judah khyanga kyaki ni Judah kcanga a kya ve. Acunüng, vun mawih kcang cun, cayuk sawxata am kya lü, Judah kcang cun Ngmüimkhya am mlung mawiha kyaki. Acun naw khyanga mhlünmtainak yahkia am kya lü Pamhnama mhlünmtainak yahkia kyaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Judahe cun khyangmjükcee kthaka ami kyäpnak bawk veki aw? Vun mawih khameinak cun kü bawki aw? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Akcanga anaküt üng akcüka Pamhnam naw amäta ngthu cun Judahe üng jah peki. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Judah avangea am ami sitihnak naw Pamhnam cun am sitihkia thawnsak thei khai aw?<verse eid="ROM 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sal 51:4</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Acun kba am ni; Khyang naküt hlei sepi Pamhnam cun cangki ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Na ngthu pyen cun cang lü, ngthumkhyah üng pi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">ngnängnak na yah khai” tia Cangcim naw pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Cunsepi am dawkia mi pawhmsahnak naw Pamhnama pawhmsah naküt dawki tia a mdan üng, i mi ti thei khai ni? Pamhnam naw a jah ksücet üng Pamhnam naw akhye pawhki mi ti thei khai aw? (Ahin cun kthäh vaia nglawi kungki ni). <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Acukba am ani üng, Pamhnam am a cang üng ani naw ihawkba khawmdek ngthumkhyah pe khai ni? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Cunsepi, am ka cangnak naw Pamhnama hlüngtainak cun akcanga mdanki ni. Ise kei khyangka mäiha mkateia ka kya khai ni? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>“Akdaw a pha law vaia, mkhyekatnak mi pawh vai u” tia ise am mi ti ni? Khyang avang naw ami na mkateinak vaia ahine jah pyenkie ni. Ami yah vai kunga mkateinak yah khaie.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Upi am ngsungpyun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Acunüng, mimi Judahe cun Khyangmjükce kthaka mi dawnak veki aw? Am ve. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyangmjükcee kthaka nami daw bawki he aw? A daw lang u ki! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khyangmjükcee kthaka nami se bawki he aw? Avan ta am se u ki.</char></note>Judahe ja khyangmjükce avan cun mkhyekatnaka akea mi veki ti cun ka ning jah mhnuh päng ni.<verse eid="ROM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Sal 14:1-3</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">Sal 53:1-3</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Cangcim naw a pyena kba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Upi am ngsungpyun,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>ksingnak taki ja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Pamhnam mküimtoki matca pi am ve,<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>“Ami van naw Pamhnam nghlatakie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">akcea ami van citkie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">akdaw pawhki upi am ve, mat pi am ve.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:9">Sal 5:9</ref> (LXX); </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:3">Sal 140:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ami khyü nglung he cun thihnak vaia kya lü;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">ami mleie am hleihlaknak ngthu pyenkie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Ami mkae üng kpyukpyaia sik am beki.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Sal 10:7</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Ami pyenksake cun ng'yüncenak am beki.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7">Hesa 59:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref></char>
    </note>“Ami khawe cun khyang hnimnak da hlah u lü;<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>ami cehnak naküt üng pyüpyehnak ja khuikhanake jah ta hütkie;<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>dim’yenaka lam pi am ksing u,<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Sal 36:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Pamhnam pi am kyühei u.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Thum üng ve nakütki hin thuma keha vekiea phäha sängeikia tia mi ksingki; acunakyase, khawmdek khyange nghuingphanak käh jah mhlät lü lei naküt law püi lü Pamhnam naw avana lei cun ngthu jah mkhyah pet khaia kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 143:2">Sal 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Kal 2:16</ref></char>
    </note> Acukba, thum cun mi mkhyekatnak ksingeinak vaia ve lawkia kyase, thum üng u süm pi Pamhnama hmaia am ngsungpyun hlawt khai.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumnaka phäha ngsungpyunnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Tuhkbäih cun, Pamhnam naw amät am a jah ngsungpyunsak cun mdan pängki ni. Mosia Thum ja sahmae naw ami saksinak kyaw u lü pi Thuma bilawh vai am ve.<verse eid="ROM 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Kal 2:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acun cun, Pamhnama ngsungpyunnak, Jesuh Khritaw jumnaka phäha kya lü, jumeikie avana phäha kyaki. Acunakyase, hngalangnak am ve:<verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>khyang naküt mkhyekat lü Pamhnama hlüngtainak üngka naw thuk vaikie.<verse eid="ROM 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Jah lätlangsaki Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh, aphu am pe xa lü Pamhnama bäkhäknak am avan naw ngsungpyunnak yaha kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25-26"/>Pamhnam naw ani cun a jah pet. Ani mi jumeinak üng a thisena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25-26: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a thi üngkhyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ania thihnak üngkhyüh.</char></note> phäha ami mkhyekatnak mhlätnak vaia kyaki. Ahlana ami mkhyekatnake cun mlungsaünak am jah büktengki cunsepi atuh cun amäta ngsungpyunnak a mdannak vaia khyangea mkhyekatnak jah cijang petki. Ahikba a pawhnak am Pamhnam naw amät ngsungpyunnak mdan lü, Jesuh Khritaw jumki naküt cun pi ngsungpyunsaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 3:25-26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Acukba akya üng, mi awhcahnak vai ve khai aw? Am ve! Thum mi läk lü aw? Am ni. Jumnak üng ni akyak ve.<verse eid="ROM 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Acunakyase, khyang cun jumnak am ngsungpyun lü thuma ngjak'hlü bilawhnaka phäha am ni.<verse eid="ROM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Am ani üng Pamhnam cun Judahe däka Pamhnama kyaki aw? Khyangmjükceea Pamhnama pi am kyaki aw? Kyaki, khyangmjükceea Pamhnama pi kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:4">Deut 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Kal 3:20</ref></char>
    </note>Pamhnam mat däk kya lü, Judahe cun ami jumnaka phäha amät am jah ngsungpyunsak lü Khyangmjükcee cun ami jumnak üngkhyüh jah ngsungpyunsaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Acunakyaküng, jumeinaka phäha Thum mi hawihki aw? Am mi hawih, mi khängsaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Abraham am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Acunakyaküng, Abraham mi pupa, mi ti hin ihawkba mi ti khai ni? Abrahama pawhmsah khawi ta i ni? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abraham naw bilawhnak am ngsungpyunnak a yah vaisü üng, a awhcahnak vai sü, cunsepi Pamhnama hmaia ta acukba am ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:6">Gen 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Kal 3:6</ref></char>
    </note>Cangcim naw a pyen ta “Abraham naw Pamhnam jum lü, acuna a jumnak cun Pamhnam naw ngsungpyunnaka a ngaih pet.”<verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Khyang naw khut a bi üng, a bia phu cun amdanga a yaha am kya, hlawh lü a yaha kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Cunsepi, bilawhnak üng am ni lü jumnak am ngdüi lü Pamhnam jumkia mkhyekatnak cun ngcimki tia a ngaih pet. Isetiakyaküng Pamhnam naw acuna jumnak cun amät am jah ngsungpyunsaki tia Pamhnam naw a ngaih ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Ahin hin, Davit naw khyanga bilawhnaka phäha am ni lü, Pamhnam naw ngsungpyunkia a jah ngaih pete cun jodaw ve,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7,8:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1">Sal 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>“Ami mkhyenak jah mhlät peta khyange ja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ami katnak jah bu pete ta jekyai u se!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Bawipa naw ami mkhyekatnak am a jah kheh petea khyange cun jekyai u se” tia a pyen ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Davita pyen jekyainak cun vun mawih khamkiea phäh däka mä akya? Am kya! Vun am mawikiea phäha pi kyaki ni. Cangcim üngka mi pyena kba, “Abraham naw Pamhnam jumei lü a jumnak cun ngsungpyunkia a doei pet.”<verse eid="ROM 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Acun cun ihawkba a ngaih pet ni? Vun a mawi käna aw? Am a mawih ham üng aw? Vun a mawih käna am ni, a mawih hlana kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Gen 17:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunakyase, vun am a mawih ham üng a jumnak am ngsungpyunnak yahki tia ksingnak vaia, vun mawi lü msingnak pawhki. Acuna ngsungpyunnak cun ami phäha kya khaia, vun am mawikie üng jumeikie naküta paa kyanak thei vaia ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Ani cun vun mawikiea paa pi a kyanak sih vaia, vun mawikie cun pi mi pa Abraham naw vun am mawi lü a xün k'um üng jumnak a taka mäiha jumnak ami tak vaia ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jumnak am Pamhnama khyütam kümkawiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Gen 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Kal 3:29</ref></char>
    </note> Abraham ja a mjükphyüie naw khawmdek ami kanak vaia khyütam cun Thum a läklama phäh am ni, ani naw jum lü a jumnak cun ngsungpyunnaka a doei pet ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:18">Kal 3:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Thum läkie üng Pamhnam naw khyütam a jah pet ta jumnak cun am mdanga kya lü Pamhnama khyütam pi am mdang vai ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Thum naw Pamhnama mlungsonak lawpüiki; cunsepi thuma am a ve üng thum lümkan am ve.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:7">Kal 3:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunakyase, khyütam cun jumnak üng kya lü Pamhnam naw Abrahama mjükphyüie amdanga a jah pet cun Thum läk sawxatki üng am kya lü Abrahama juma kba jumeikie a jah pet ni. Abraham cun ngmüimkhya lama avana mi pa vaia phäh ni. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Gen 17:5</ref></char></note>Cangcim naw, “Khyangmjü khawkäna paa ka ning pyang päng ni” tia a pyena kba ni. Khyütam cun Abrahama jum Pamhnama ma daw lü acuna Pamhnam naw thikie jah xünsak lü, am vekie pi ve khaia pawhki ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Abraham naw äpei vaia anglawiki äpei lü jumnak am “ani cun khyangmjü khawhaha paa” thawn lawki. Cangcim naw, “Na mjükphyüie cun aisi kän law khaie” tia pyenki. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Gen 17:17</ref></char></note>A khawkum a phya law khyäü khaia a mtisa xü lü a yängsänak am ve sepi, a jumnak am ngcek law. Sarah pi am ca khawh ti. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>A jumnak am khyah, Pamhnama khyütam pi jumeiki. A jumnak cun johit üng be lü Pamhnam mhlünmtaiki. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Pamhnam naw khyütam cun kümkawi lawsak thei khai tia süm lü a jumnak khäng law bawki. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Acunakyase Abraham cun a jumnak üng ngsungpyunkia Pamhnam naw ngaih petki. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Acunakyase, “A jumnak cun a ngsungpyunnaka ngaiha kyaki” ti cun, amäta phäh däka yuka am kya lü, <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>mimia phäha pi kyaki. Mi Bawipa Jesuh, kthihnak üngkhyüh mtho beki mi jumkia kyase, mi jumnak cun ngsungpyunnaka ngai vaia kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Hesa 53:4</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:5">5</ref></char></note>Acuna Jesuh cun, mi mkhyekatnaka phäha thikia kya lü, Pamhnam am mi ngsungpyunnak vaia phäh mthawh bea kyaki ni.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnam üng ng’yäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Atuha, jumnaka phäh Pamhnam am ngsungpyunnak mi yahki, Bawi Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi taki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi ta vai u.</char></note>Pamhnam am dim’yenak mi taki. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Atuha mi xünnaka jumnak üng Pamhnama bäkhäknak mi ksing khaia jah law püiki. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi camcahki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi camcah vai u.</char></note>Pamhnama hlüngtainak yümei lü äpeinak am mi awhcahki. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Acunüng, acun däka am kyase, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi camcah hngaki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi camcah hnga vai u.</char></note>mi khuikhanak üng je u lü mi ve vai u, khuikhanak naw khameinak khawh lawpüiki, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>khameinak khawh naw Pamhnama ksingnak lawpüi lü Pamhnama ksingnak naw äpeinak ve lawsaki; <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>acunüng, mi veia a jah peta Ngmüimkhya Ngcim naw, Pamhnama mhläkphyanak cun, mi mlungkyawng k'uma a büih law pänga phäha, äpeinak naw am jah helatsak khai. <verse eid="ROM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Jah kpüi khai am a ve üng pi Pamhnama xüa kcün üng Khritaw cun mkhyeki khyange phäha thi lawki. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Khyang ngsungpyunkia phäha thih vai khak khai, khyang kdawa phäha ta a thih vai lingki ve taw khai. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Mkhyekatnak am mi ve k'um üng, Khritaw mi phäha a thihnak am, Pamhnam naw ihlawka a jah mhläkphyanak cun mdanki. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Acunakyase, tuhkbäih cun, a thisena phäha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ania thi üngkhyüh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ania thihnak üngkhyüh.</char></note> ngsungpyunnak mi yah lü, acuna Bawipaa phäha, Pamhnama mlungsonak üngka naw ihlawka küikyannak mi yah khai ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Pamhnama yea mi kya k'um üng pi, a Cakpaa a thihnaka phäh Pamhnama püia mi kya law beki. Tuhbäih ta Pamhnama püia mi kyakia kyase Khritawa xünnak am ihlawka küikyannak mi yah khai. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Acun däka am kyase, tuhkbäih mi Bawipa Jesuh khritaw üng Pamhnam püiea jah pyangkia kyase mi jekyaiki.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adam ja Khritaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Gen 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, khyang mata phäha khawmdeka khana mkhyekatnak pha law lü, mkhyekatnaka phäh thihnak a pha lawa mäiha, khyang naküt cun mkhyekatnaka phäha thihnaka phakie, isetiakyaküng khyang avan ami mkhyekata phäh ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Thum am a ve ham üng khawmdek khana mkhyekatnak ve pängki. Cunsepi Thum am a ve üng mkhyekatnake am ve u. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Cunsepi, Adam üng tün lü Mosia ve law cäpa, Adam naw Pamhnama mtheh am ngja lü a mkhyekata mäiha mkhyekatnak am pawhkiea khana pi thihnak ve lawki. Adam cun ve law khai üng mtängnaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Cunsepi, bäkhäknak ja mkhyekatnak am täng. Isetiakyaküng, Pamhnama bäkhäknak cun Adama mkhyekatnak am, am täng. Khyang mata mkhyekata phäha khyang khawhah thiki. Cunsepi, khyang mat Jesuh Khritawa phäha khyang khawhah naw Pamhnam naw amdanga a jah yeta bäkhäknak yahkiea kyase Pamhnama bäkhäknak cun dämduh bawki ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Khyang mata mkhyekatnak ja Pamhnam naw amdanga a jah yet cun am täng ni. Khyang mat a mkhye käna “Mkhyekatnaka” ngthumkhyahnak pha lawki. Cunsepi mkhyenak khawhaha ve law käna “Mkhyekatnak am pawhkia kba” am yah ngkawiha bäkhäknak cun yahki ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Mata mkhyekatnaka phäha pi thihnak naw a jah uk law üng, khyang mat, Jesuh Khritaw bilawha phäh ihlawk dämduhki mi yah khai ni. A bäkhäknak khawhaha yahei lü Khritaw üngkhyüh akxüng mi up lü ani am ngsungpyunsak yahei khaie ni. <verse eid="ROM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Acunakyase, mata mkhyenak naw khyang naküt jah mkateiki. Acuna mäiha khyang mata ngsungpyunnak naw ngsungpyunnak ja xünnaka khyang naküt jah phapüiki. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Khyang mat naw pyen am a ngjaka phäha khyang naküt mkhyekatnak am belawki he; acuna mäiha, khyang mat naw pyen a ngjak phäha khyang naküt ngsungpyun khaie. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Thum pha law lü mkhyekatnak nung lawki. Cunsepi, mkhyekatnak a nungnak naküta Pamhnama bäkhäknak däm law bawki. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Mkhyekatnak naw thihnak am jah uk lü Pamhnama bäkhäknak naw ngsungpyunnak am uk lü mi Bawipa Jesuh khritaw üngka naw anglät xünnaka jah cehpüiki.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mkhyekatnak thih ta u lü Khritaw üng xünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Acunüng, i mi pyen khai? A bäkhäknaka dämnak vaia mkhyekatnak üng mi xüngei laih laih khai aw? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Acun kba am ni, mkhyekatnak üng mi thi pängki cun mkhyekatnak üng ihawkba mi xüng be khai? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Khritaw Jesuh üng baptican khankie naküt cun a thihnak üng baptican khanki tia am nami ksingki aw? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref></char></note>Acunakyase, a thihnak üng baptican mi khan üng a hlawnga mi ng’ut yümki; Pa a hlüngtainak am thihnak üngka naw Khritawa thawh bea kba mimi pi xüngnak kthai am mi ve hnga khai.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Baptican mi khamnak am a thihnak üng mi thih hnga u lü xünnak üng a mät am atänga mi tho be yüm khai. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Mkhyekatnak mtisa kpyehnak vai ja, mkhyekatnaka mpyaa am mi kyanak ti vaia mi khyang kphyüm cun amät am kutlamktung üng taih pänga kyaki tia mi ksingki. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>A u pi, thih pängki cun mkhyekatnak üngka naw lätki ni. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Acunüng, Khritawa am mi thi pängkia akya üng a hlawnga mi xüng hnga khai tia mi jumki. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Khritaw cun, thihnak üngka naw mthawh bea kyaki, am thi be ti khai ti mi ksingki; thihnak naw a khana ngnängnak johit am ta ti. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>A thihnak cun mkhyekatnak lama anglät vaia mat däka thiki, a xüngnak üng Pamhnama phäha xüngki. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Acun kba bä, nangmi haw mkhyekatnak lama thi pängkia ngaiei u lü, Pamhnam da Jesuh khritaw üng nami xüngkia ngai kyu ua. <verse eid="ROM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Acunakyase, thi theikia nami mtisaa ngjak'hlü nami pawh msawk üngpi mkhyekatnak naw nami mtisa üng nängnak käh yah kawm. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Nami mtisa, kutkhawe cun nami mkhyekatnak vaia akse lama käh jah sumei ua; thihnak üngka naw tho bekia mäiha, Pamhnama veia ngpeei u lü, nami mtisa, kutkhawe pi ngsungpyunnak vaia kya u se. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Mkhyekatnak cun nami bawia käh kyase, thuma keha nami xüngki am ni, Pamhnama bäkhäknaka keha nami xüngki ni.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngsungpyunnaka mpyae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Acunüng ihawkba kya khai? Thuma keha am mi ve ti lü a bäkhäknak keha mi vekia kyase mkhyekatnak mi pawh khai aw? Acukba am kya. <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Ua veia pi kyase, a ngthu ngai khaia mpyaa nami kya käna, thihnak vaia katnaka mpyaa pi kyase, ngsungpyunnak vaia ngthu ngainaka mpyaea pi kyase, a ngthu nami ngaiha a mpyaa nami kyaki ti am nami ksingki aw? <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Pamhnam je na ua! Nangmi cun mkhyekatnaka mpyaea kya khawi uki lüpi ning jah mtheia ngthungtak cun nami mlung am nami kcangnaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Mkhyekatnak üngka naw nami lät pängkia kyase ngsungpyunnaka mpyaa nami kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Am nami ksing theikia kyase nghngicima khyübe am ka ning jah mthehki. Nami mtisa ja nami kutkhawe cun ajana am ngcimcaihki ja phyawksak ksehlen khaia nami peta mäiha, tuhkbäih nami mtisa ja nami kutkhawe cun ngcimcaih khaia ngsungpyunnaka mpya thawnsak ua.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Mkhyekatnaka mpya üng nami ve ham üng, ngsungpyunnak üng nami lätki. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Atuha nami ngkeeinak nami jah bilawhe cun i nami daw na khawiki ni? Acunea dütnak cun thihnaka ni akya ve. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Cunsepi, tuhkbäih cun mkhyekatnak üngka naw lät u lü Pamhnama mpyaea nami kya lawkia kyase, ngcimcaihnak nami ngmangnaki. Adütnak cun anglät xüngnaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Mkhyekatnaka phu cun thihnaka kyaki cunsepi, Pamhnam naw amdang a jah yeta a bäkhäknak cun mi Bawipa Jesuh khritaw üng anglät xünaka kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ngkhyunglanak am msuimcäpnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Acunakyase, ka püie aw, thum nami ksingkiea kyase i ka pyen khai ti cun nami ksingkie ni. Khyang a xünga küt üng thum naw upki. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Avaisüa a cei vekia nghnumi cun a cei am a thiha küt üng thuma keha veki, a cei a thih käna cei mahnaka thum üng lätki. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Acunakyase, a cei a xüng k'um üng kpami akce a vepüi üng ani cun a ceia khana am sitihki ti khaie. A cei a thih üng ta acuna thum üngka naw mhläta kyase, akce a ceinak be üng pi nghnumi “am sitihkia” am kya. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Acunakyase, ka püie aw, Thum cun asängeia küt üng nangmi pi nami thiki, isetiakyaküng nangmi cun Khritawa kphyema nami kyaki. Nangmi cun thihnak üngka naw tho beki Jesuha mtisa kyase nangmi cun Pamhnama khut pawhnak üng ning jah summangei vai ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Mtisa thuma mi xüngsei üng thum naw mtisa mkhyekatnak mthümhlet law se Thum naw mtisa üng khut bi lü avan thihnak üng mi dütki. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Cunsepi, tuhkbäihta jah mankia Thum üngka naw mi lätki, isetiakyaküng, acun üng mimi cun mi thi pängkia akyaka phäha ni. Thum kphyüm üng yuka kba mi khüikia am kya lü, Ngmüimkhya thum kthai üng mi khüiki ni.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thum ja mkhyekatnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Ex 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Deut 5:21</ref></char>
    </note> Acunüng, Thum a mät kung hin mkhyekatnaka kyaki mi ti khai aw? Am ni! Cunsepi, Mkhyekatnak na ksingsaki cun Thum ni. “Khyanga ka käh na hnaihei vai,” tia Thum naw am a pyen üng ta acuna hnaiheinak ta ini tia am ksing veng. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Cunsepi, mkhyekatnak naw ngthupet ngmangei na lü hnaiheinak naküt ka khana ve lawsaki. Thuma kaa mkhyekatnak akthi ni. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Kamät kung pi thuma kaa ka xüngki; cunsepi ngthupet a ve law ja, mkhyekatnak xüng lawki; <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Acunüng, kei ka thiki. Xünnak vaia ngthupet cun ka phäha thihnaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Gen 3:13</ref></char></note>Mkhyekatnak naw thum ngmangei na lü, na mhlei lü acuna thum am na hnimki. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Acunakyase, Thum cun ngcimcaihki, acunüng ngthupet cun ngcimcaih lü ngsungpyun lü dawki. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Akdaw pawh cun, ka phäha thihnaka kyaki aw? Am kya. Mkhyekatnak ni ka phäha thihnaka a kya ve; acunakyase, mkhyekatnak cun mkhyekatnak tia angdangnak thei vaia akdaw sumei lü na hnimki; mkhyekatnak cun ngthupeta phäha aktäa mkhyekatnak tia mdanki.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyanga k'uma ngcuhngkaihnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Thum cun ngmüimkya lama kyaki tia mi ksingki; cunsepi, kei cun mtisa lama mkhyekatnaka mpyaa jawiha ka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Kal 5:17</ref></char></note>Ka pawh am ka ksingki; ka pawh hlü am pawh lü, acuna hnün üng am ka hlüei ka pawhki. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Acukba am ka pawh hlü ka pawh üng Thum cun cangki tia ka jumki. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Acunakyase, acuna am dawki ka pawh cun keia pawha am kya lü, mkhyekatnak kei üng vekia a pawha ni akya ve. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Kei üng akdaw i am ve tia ka ksingki; acun hin mtisa lama kyaki, akdaw pawh hlünak cun kei üng ve teki, akdaw i am pawh ngü. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Akdaw ka pawh hlü am pawh lü; acuna nghnün üng am ka pawh hlü akse ka pawhki. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Am ka pawh hlü ka pawh khawi üng, pawhki cun keia am kya lü, mkhyekatnak kei üng vekia ni akya ve. <verse eid="ROM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Acunakyase, hina thum ka ksing lawki; akdaw pawh vai ka ti üng akse ni ka xüei ta.<verse eid="ROM 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Ka mlungkyawng kcang üng cun Pamhnama thum üng aktäa ka jeki. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Cunsepi, ka mtisa ja ka kutkhawe üng thum kce veki tia ka ksingki, acun naw ka mlungkyawng thum ngcawhpüi lü, ka mtisa ja ka kutkhawe üng vekia mkhyekatnak ngthupeta kut üng mpyaa na pawhki. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Khuikha veng! Thihnaka na cehpüiki hina mtisa üngkhyüh u naw na yung khai ni? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa üngkhyüh ahin pawhkia Pamhnama veia jenak ka mthehki. Acunakyase, ka mlungmthin lama Pamhnama thuma mpyaa ka kyaki, mtisa lama mkhyekatnaka thuma mpyaa ka kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ngmüimkhya üng xünnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Acunakyase, tuhkbäih Khritaw Jesuh üng vekiea phäha mkatnak am ve ti. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Ngmüimkhya thum naw Jesuh khritaw üngkhyüh lawki xünnak ning jah pe khai. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akce üng veki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">keimi.</char></note>Acuna xünnak naw mkhyekatnak ja thihnak üngkhyüh ning jah mhlät pängki. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Ktha ngcekia nghngicim kyase Thum naw am a pawh khawh cun Pamhnam naw a pawh ni. Pamhnam naw nghngicima mäiha amäta Cakpa Jesuh Khritaw tüih law lü ani cun mkhyemsawhki nghngicima mäia law lü mkhyekatnak cun nängeiki. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Pamhnam naw a pawh hin ngsungpyunki ngjak'hlü Thum cun mimi üng kümkawi lü mimi Ngmüimkhya üng xüng. Acun hin nghngicima mtisa lama am kya. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Pumsa thuma vekie naw mtisa lama ami mlung takie; Ngmüimkhya thuma vekie naw Ngmüimkhya lama ami mlung takie. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Pumsa lama mlung tak cun thihnaka kyaki, Ngmüimkhya lama mlung tak cun xünnak ja dim’yenaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Acunakyase, mtisa thum üng xün law üng Pamhnama yea kya lawki he. Pamhnam thum am läk u lü a läka pi am läk khawh u. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Acunakyase, mtisa thuma vekie naw, Pamhnam am jesak thei u.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Cunsepi, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya nangmi üng ve kcangkia akya üng mtisa üng am ve u lü, Ngmüimkhya üng nami veki ni. Cunsepi, u pi Khritawa Ngmüimkhya am taki cun ania khyanga am kya. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Cunsepi, Khritaw nangmi üng a ve üng, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngmüimkhya cun nanga phäh sa ni; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">na Ngmüimkhya xüngki.</char></note>mkhyekatnaka phäha thi khai mtisa pi Pamhnam am nami ngsungpyunkia kyase Ngmüimkhya cun nami xüngnaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kor 3:16</ref></char></note>Jesuh thihnak üngkhyüh mtho bekia Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya nangmi üng a ve ta, Khritaw thihnak üngkhyüh mtho beki nami k'uma veki ania Ngmüimkhya naw thi theikia nami mtisa üngpi xünnak ning jah pe khai.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Acunakyase, ka püie aw, mi mta veki, lüpi mtisa thuma a hlüeia mi xün khaia am kya. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Mtisa thuma nami ve üng nami thi khai; cunsepi, mtisa bilawhe cun Ngmüimkya am nami ja thihsak üng nami xüng khai. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Pamhnama Ngmüimkya naw a jah khyüisawe cun Pamhnama caa kyakie. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Kal 4:5-7</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Kal 4:6</ref></char></note>Pamhnam naw a ning jah peta Ngmüimkhya naw kyühnak ja mpya kyanak be am ning jah pe. Lüpi Ngmüimkhya naw Pamhnama ca thawnnak ja “ka Pa, ka Pa” ti lü ngkhünak vaia ngmüimkhyaa johit ning jah petki. <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Acuna Ngmüimkya Ngcim kung naw mi ngmüimkya üng Pamhnama caea mi kyaki ti cun jah ksingsaki; <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>A caea mi kyak üng a khyangea phäh a tak khawhthem mi yah khai. Pamhnam naw Khritaw üng a tak pet khawhthem pi mi yah khai isetiakyaküng Khritawa khuikhanak pi mi khameipüi lü a hlüngtainak pi mi yümeipüi khai.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hlüngtainak ve law khai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Tuhkbäih khuikhanake hin, malama hlüngtainak ngdang law khai üng am jah mtäng phyaki ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>A mhnünmcenge naküt naw äpeinak am, Pamhnama caea ngdang lawnak vai k'äihkie. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Gen 3:17-19</ref></char></note>A mhnünmcenge naw ami vecawh ning ami mkhyüh hin ami hlüeia am kya lüpi Pamhnam naw acukba a hlüeia kyaki. Lüpi äpeinak veki, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>A mhnünmcenge kung pi pyüpyenaka mpya üngka naw jah mhläta kya khai, Pamhnama caea hlüngtaikia lätnak yah hnga khaiea kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>A mhnünmcenge naküt tuhvei cäpa ngko u lü na hmi law khaia nghnumia mäiha jah msomhlei u lü vekie tia mi ksingki. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2Kor 5:2-4</ref></char></note>Mhnünmceng däka am kyase, Pamhnam naw amdanga a jah yeta Ngmüimkhya mi taki pi mi mlung k'uma mi ngkoki. Pamhnama caa mi kyaknak vai ja a mhnünmcenge a jah <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang yuknak üng am ve</char><char style="fq" closed="false">a canaea jah pawh lü.</char></note>mhlät vai pi mi k'äihei sihki. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Äpeinak am küikyannak mi yah ve; cunsepi, hmu u lü äpei cun äpeinaka am kya. Khyang naw a hmuh thei cun ihawkba mi äpei khai ni? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Am mi hmuh thei mi äpei üng, mlung msaünak am mi k'äih khai.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Acun käna, Ngmüimkhya naw am mi kyannake üng ja kpüiki. Mi ktaiyü üng ihawkba ktaiyü vai tia am mi ksing. Cunsepi, mi ktaiyü üng ngthu üng am pyen theia ngkonak am Ngmüimkhya naw ngko lü jah ktaiyü peki. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Acunüng, Mi mlung jah teng lü Ngmüimkhya naw i cungaiki ti cun ksingki, isetiakyaküng khyangea kcaha Pamhnama veia a ktaiyü hin Pamhnama ngjak'hlüa kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Avan üng atänga Pamhnam mhläkphyanakie, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnam naw ani kphyanakie phäha anaküt hin akdawa pawhki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnam jawngnakie phäh anaküt hin dawki.</char></note>a titänga a jah khüea phäha akdaw vaia biloki tia mi ksingki. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>A jah ksing pänge cun amäta a ca mäiha ve khaiea a jah na mhnün päng, a Cakpa cun bena khawhahea ksunga ca kcüka a kya lawnak thei vaia kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Acunakyase a jah na phyäi pänge ni a jah khü; a jah khüe ni amät am a jah ngsungpyunsak; a jah ngsungpyunsak pänge ni a jah mhlünmtai.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritaw Jesuh üng Pamhnama mhläkphyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Acunüng a hina ngthue üng i mi pyen thei khai? Pamhnam mimi phäha a ve üng u naw jah tu thei khai ni? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Amäta Cakpa pi am kpamei lü mi vana phäha jah peki naw, avan naküt amdanga am jah pet sih khai aw? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Pamhnama xüa khyange cun u naw jah ksekha na thei khai ni? Pamhnam amät kung naw am mkhyekat u a ti. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>U naw jah mkatei thei khai ni? Khritaw Jesuh naw am jah mkatei. Thi lü, thi däkia am kya lü, thihnak üngka naw tho law be lü Pamhnama khet lama ve lü jah ktaiyü peki cun Khritawa kyaki ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Khritawa mhläkphyanak üngka naw u naw ja mtai thei khai aw? Khuikhatnak naw pi kyase, khaknak naw pi kyase, mkhuimkhanak naw pi kyase, cawixainak naw pi kyase, akpuma venak naw pi kyase, kyühkyawknak naw pi kyase, thihnak naw pi kyase, jah mtai thei khai aw?<verse eid="ROM 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:22">Sal 44:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nanga phäha anglät se thihnak vai üng kami veki; hnim vaia toca mäia ami jah pawh” tia Cangcim naw pyenki. <verse eid="ROM 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Am jah mtai, jah jawngnakia a bäkhäknaka phäha acune naküt kami jah näng päng ni. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Isetiakyaküng, thihnaka pi kyase, xünaka pi kyase, khankhaw ngsäa pi kyase, khawyai ksea pi kyase, khankhaw anaa pi kyase, tuhkbäih üngkaea pi kyase, tuha ve law khaiea pi kyase, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>ak’hlünga pi kyase, aknema pi kyase, mhnünmceng naküt üngka i naw pi, mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw vei mi yaha Pamhnama mhläkphyanak üngka naw am jah mtai thei khai tia akcanga ka ksingki.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnam ja a khyange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Khritaw üng, ngthu kcang ka pyenki, am ka hleiki ni, Ngmüimkhya Ngcima phäha, akdaw ja akse ksingnak thei naw pi na ksingpüi se, <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>ka khuikhanak ka pyen üng mlung üng am düt theikia natnak ka taki. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Ka khyange mtisa lama ka mjüea phäh kei hin Khritaw üngka naw mtai lü yüncenak ka yah vaia pi hlüei kyaw veng. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Ex 4:22</ref></char></note>Isarel khyangea kyakiea kyase, caea thawnak, hlüngtainak, khyütame ja Thum jah pe lü ngthumkhän<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bekhüte; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">bekhüt.</char></note> a jah pawh püi. Pamhnam hjawkhahnak ja äpeinake naküt cun ami kaa kya lü; <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>ami cun nglongthangkie Hebru pupae üngka naw lawki he. Pumsa lama Khritaw cun amimi üngka naw lawki; Ani cun avan naküta khana veki, angläta mhlünmtai phyakia Pamhnama kyaki! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">avana khana jah upki Pamhnam angläta mhlünmtainak ve se!; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">avan jah uki Pamhnam, ania khana angläta mhlünmtainak ve se!</char></note>Amen. <verse eid="ROM 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Cunsepi, Pamhnama ngthu cun am ngtähki tia am pyen veng. Isarela mjükphyüie naküt, Isarel kcanga kya päihkiea am kya; <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Gen 21:12</ref></char></note>Abrahama mjükphyüia ami kyaa phäha ami van Abrahama caa am kya u; “Khyütam ka ning peta mjükphyüi cun Isak üngkhyüh na yah khai” tia kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Acun cun, mtisa lama cae cun <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8:</char><char style="fk" closed="false">hnasen he ani hmi khawia kba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hin naw a pyennak hlü ta Abraham ja Hakarah ami ca Ihsamelaha ksawn a pyen ni (Bük Kal 4:22-23)</char></note>Pamhnama caea am kya u lü khyütamnak am cae cun Abrahama caea kyakie tinaka kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Gen 18:10</ref></char></note>Pamhnama khyütam cun hina kyaki; “Atuh üngka naw, akcün kümkawi lü <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akcün a kha üng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pha law khai kum ahina kcün.</char></note>ka law üng, Sarah naw kpamica ca na khai” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Acun däka am kya, Rabeka naw mi pu Isaka phäh angphi a mpyainak üng, <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>na ca xawi am ani hmi law ham üng, akdaw ja akse am ani pawh thei ham üng, pawhmsaha phäha am kya lü, khüikia mlung ngaih däka kya lü, xünak üng, Pamhnama bünak a khäng vaia, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Gen 25:23</ref></char></note>a veia, “Angvai cun akdika mpyaa kya khai” tia Pamhnam naw a pyen. <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref></char></note>“Jakop jawng na lü Etaw ka hnengki” tia Cangcim naw a pyen.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>I mi pyen vai veki? Pamhnam cun am ngsungpyunki mi ti khai aw? Pamhnam am ngsungpyunkia am kya. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Ex 33:19</ref></char></note>Pamhnam naw, “Ka mpyenei hlü, mpyenei lü, ka bänak hlü ka bänak khai” tia, Mosia veia a pyen. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Acunakyase, anaküt cun khyanga ngjak'hlü am kya lü Pamhnama mpyeneinaka phäha ni akya ve. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Ex 9:16</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Cangcim naw Pharoa veia, “Ka khyaihnak nang üngka mdan vaia phäha ja ka ngming khawmdek avan üng a ngthang hünak vaia ka ning mhlünmtaiki” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnam naw a mpyenei hlü mpyenei lü, a mlung a ngcangsak hlü ngcangsaki.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama mlungsonak ja mpyeneinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Acunakyaküng, “Pamhnam naw ise jah mkateiki ni? U naw a ngjak'hlü mkhyeki ni?” Mat mat naw ti taw khai. <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Hesa 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></note>Cunsepi, ka püi aw, Pamhnam na ngcuhpüi khaia ta nang u ni? Mdek k’am naw sepkia khyang üng, “I vai ahikba na na pyan ni?” ti lü am kthäh khawi. <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>K’amksep naw, mdek üngka lo lü mat akdawa sep lü, mata sep sawxat khaia ana taki ni. K’amksep naw mdek cun a ngjak'hlüa am sumei khai aw? <verse eid="ROM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Pamhnama bilawhnak üng pi acun kba kyaki. A mlung sonak mdan lü a johit a ngsingnaksak vaia kyaki. Cunsepi a mlungsonak khamei lü, pyüpyeh khaie khana mlung saünak taki. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>A hlüngtainak yah khaia a jah mhnüna mi kyakia mimia khana a jah peta dämdakia a hlüngtainak cun, a bäkhäknak makie khana pi a mdan vai pawhki. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Judahe däk üngkaa am kya lü, Khyangmjükcee üngkae pi a jah khü. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char></note>Hosia cauk üng, “Ka khyanga am kya khawikie, ‘ka khyange’ ka jah ti na khai. Acunüng am ka mhläkphyanak khawie cun ‘ka mhläkphyanake’ ka ti khai.<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, ami veia hikba kya law khai, ‘Ka khyangea am nami kyakia’ hnün üng xüngseiki Pamhnama cae tia ngsui law khaie” tia pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22">Hesa 10:22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Hesajah naw pi Isarele jah pyen naki naw, “Isarele cun, tuinu kama, kdiyüta mäiha däm u sepi avange däk naw ni küikyannak ami yah kawm. <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Bawipa naw khawmdek khana khyange cun angenga ngthu jah mkhyah pe khaia pha law khai” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Hesa 1:9</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Hesajah kung naw, “Hlüngtai säihki Bawipa naw mi mjükphyüie am a jah phyäi vai sü üng ta, Sodom mlüh ja Komorah mlüha mäiha mi kham khaie sü” tia a na pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isarele ja Thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Khyangmjükcee vei mi pyen vai ta amimät jah amimät Pamhnam üng am ngsungpyun hlü u lü amimäta pawhmsah üng ngsungpyun hlükie cun jumnak am amät am a jah ngsungpyunsak. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Isarele ngsungpyunnaka thum ktämkie naw ngsungpyunnaka thum am hmu ve u. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Ise ni? Jumnak üng am ktäm u lü bilawhnak am yah theia mäiha ami ktäma phäha kyaki. “Ngsukeinaka lung” üng ngsukeikie. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Hesa 28:16</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Cangcim naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Tenga khyangea ngsukeinak vai lung ja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">kyukngtänaka lungnu cun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Zion mcunga ka taki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">au pi Ani jumeikie naküt cun am hela u” tia pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ka püie aw, Isarele küikyana ami yahnak thei vaia, ka mlunga ngjak'hlüa kyase, Pamhnama veia ka ktaiyüki. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Ksingnak kcang am ta u sepi Pamhnam da aktäa ktha nakie tia ka ning jah mtheh veng. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Pamhnam naw amät am a jah ngsungpyunsak cun am ksing u, acuna hnün üng amimäta lam pyangei u lü Pamhnam naw khyang a jah ngsungpyunsaka k'uma am law u. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Khritaw cun jumeikie naküt naw ngsungpyunnak ami yah vaia Khritaw naw thum dütsaki.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyang naküta phäh küikyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mosi naw a yuka mawng ta Thum kcangnaki cun Pamhnam naw ngsungpyunsak khai, “Thuma pyen naküt cun ngaiki ta xüng khai” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Deut 30:12-14</ref></char></note> Cangcim naw jumeinak am ngsungpyunnak a pyen cun hin ni, “Khankhawa u kai khai? (Acun cun khritaw kyum lawpüi khai kyaki) <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>“Mcea u kyum khai? (Acun cun thihnak üngka naw khritaw lawpüi khai tinaka kyaki) tia na ngthäh khai aw? <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Acunüng, pyen be tü lü, “Ngthu naw ni k’et ve, na mka ja na mlung k'uma ve ve” a ti; acun cun jumnaka ngthu kami sang khawi, <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>“Na mlung am Jesuh cun Bawipa ni tia pyen lü, thihnak üngka naw Pamhnam naw mthobeki tia na mlung k'uma na jum üng küikyannak na kya khai” ti cen. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Mlung k'uma jumnak am Pamhnam üng ngsungpyunnak mi yahki; mpyawng am pyen lü khyang naw küikyannak yahki. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Hesa 28:16</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Cangcim naw, “A u pi ani jumki naküt cun am hela khai ni” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Judah ja Krik ami hngalangnak i am ve. Bawipa mat ami vana khana Bawia kyaki, a ngming khüki naküta khana dawnak khawhah am, jah kbeki. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>“A u pi Bawipa ngming khüki naküt cun küikyannak yah khaie” tia kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Acunüng, am ami jum cun ihawkba khü khaie? Ngthu am ami ngjak üng ihawkba jum khaie? Sangki am a ve üng ihawkba ngja khaie? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Hesa 52:7</ref></char></note> Tuha khyang am a ve üng ihawkba sang thei khaie? Acuna kba, Cangcim naw “Thangkdaw lawpüiki ngsä he law vai cun ihlawka müncam phyaki ni” tia pyenki. <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Hesa 53:1</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Cunsepi, Thangkdaw cun ami van naw am jum päih u. Acunakyase, Hesajah naw, “Bawipa aw kami ngthu pyen u naw jumki ni?” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Acunakyase, jumeinak cun ngthu ngjaknak üngka naw lawki, ngthu cun Khritawa mawng sangnak üngka naw lawki.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Sal 19:4</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Acunüng, ami nghnga üng, am ngjakie aw? Ngjakie. Cangcim üng, “Ami kthai cun pe naküt üng ngthang hü lü, ami ngthu pi khawmdeka dütnak cäpa ngthang hüki” tia veki.<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Deut 32:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka ning kthäh be tüki; ‘Isarele naw am ksingkie aw? Pamhnam üng Mosi amät naw a kcüka a msang vai ta; “Pacaa am nglawikie jah summangei lü, ka xüa khyange ka jah ngkei lawsak khai; khyangmjükcee am ka xüa khyangea mlung ka sosak khai” tia kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Hesa 65:1</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Acunüng Hesajah naw, ling lü, “Am na suikie naw na hmu u lü, am na khükiea veia ka ngdang khai” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:2">Hesa 65:2</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Acunüng, Isarelea mawng pyen be tü lü, “Amhnüpa mtheh am ngja u lü, kpetmjakie veia ka kut ka säng khai” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Isarele khana Pamhnama mpyeneinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Phi 3:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, Pamhnam naw a khyange jah mahki aw? Am ja mah. Kei pi Isarel khyang, Abrahama mjükphyüi, Benjamina sang üngkaa ka kyaki ni. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Pamhnam naw akcüka a jah xüpänga khyange am jah mah khawi. Cangcim naw Elijaha mawng a pyen am nami ngja khawiki aw? Elijah naw Isarelea mawng Pamhnama veia pyen lü, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Sang 19:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note> “Bawipa, na sahmae jah hnim u lü; na kpyawngkunge jah kpyeh u se, kei däk ka xüngki, kei pi na hnim khaiea bükie ni” a ti. <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Sang 19:18</ref></char></note>Acunüng, Pamhnam naw ihawkba jah a msang be? “Am dawkia Baal mhnam am mküimtokiea khyang thawng khyüh ka phäha ka jah taki” ti lü a msang. <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Acukba tuhkbäih pi, a bäkhäknak am a jah xü, ajaw ve hamkie. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>A bäkhäknak üng a jah xüa akya üng, bilawhnak üng am kya; acukba am akya üng bäkhäknak cun bäkhäknak kcanga mäi am law.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>I mi pyen khai? Isarele naw ami sui am hmu u. A xüea khyang ngcek naw ni ami sui cun ami hmuh u. Aknung bawk naw Pamhnama khünak am ngja u. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Deut 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Hesa 29:10</ref></char></note>Cangcim üng, “Pamhnam naw tuhkbäih däa ami mlung ja ami ksingnak jah nghmüpsak se tuhvei cäpa am hmu ngja u” tia pyenki. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9,10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Sal 69:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acunüng, Davit naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Ami eiawknak cun ami ng’awhnak vaia kya lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ami kyukngtänak vaia pi kyase;<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Am hmu thei khaiea, ami mik pi mü law se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">khuikhanaka maa anglät se jah ngkunsak vai” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Ka ning jah kthähki, Isarele cun kyuktäng pyawce khaiea ngvänkie aw? Acukba am kya. Isarelea mkhyekatnak cun khyangmjüceea phäh küikyannak vai ja kya law lü Isarele naw jah k’eihkie.<verse eid="ROM 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Isarelea mkhyekatnak naw khawmdeka bawimangnaka kya lü Ngmüimkhya lama khuikhakie khyangmjücea phäh bawimangnak lawpüiki. Ami kümbenak ami law vai süa ta ihlawka daw khai ni.<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyangmjükcea küikyanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Tuhkbäih Khyangmjükceea veia ka pyenki. Khyangmjükceea veia ngsäa ka kyaa küt üng, ka khutbi ka awhcahnaki. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Acun cun, kamäta khyange k’eihnak ta khaiea ja pawh lü, avange ka jah küikyannak vaia kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ami mahnak cun khawmdek khyang naküta phäh Pamhnama ye üngka naw a püia nglat law bekie ni. Ami a jah dokham cun ihawkba vai ni? Acun cun akthiea phäh xünnak vai ni.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Acunüng, muk pyan ma Pamhnam üng pet üng, muk avan pi a kaa kya khai, thinga pyae Pamhnam üng pet üng a ngbane pi a kaa kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Nglina olip ngban avang ek se, olip kcanga am kyaki acun üng ngsu law khaie. Olip kcang am nikia nangmi khyangmjükcee cun Judahea ngmüimkhya xünak nami yumeipüikie ni, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>a ngban eke käh jah hmumsita. Nang cun a ngban kya lü käh awhcaha. Awhcah lü pi nang aphung na mcahkia am na kyaki, aphung naw ni a ning mcah ve.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Acunüng, nang naw, “Ä! ekia ngban naw ka phäha hnün na peki na ti khai.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Cang ve, am ami jumeia phäha jah k’eha kyaki, nang na jumeinaka phäha na ngdüiki. Käh awhcah lü kyüheia. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Pamhnam naw a ngban kcange pi am a jah msawk üng, nang pi am ning msawk law sawxat khai. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Acunakyase Pamhnama a dawnak ja a kyühksenak cän ngaia, kyukngtängkiea phäha kyüh phyaki ni; a dawnak üng na ve nglät üng nanga phäha cun dawki ni; am acunüng ta nang pi ning ksawmpata na kya hnga khai. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Acunüng, Judahe naw am ami jumnak ami hawih üng ami venak khawia ve be khaie, Pamhnam naw acukba jah pawh khawhki. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Nang olip kcanga am na kyaki pi ni ksawm u lü, am nami tängkia olip thing kdaw üng ning mdüna akya üng, a ngbane kcang cun ami phung kung olip thing üng jah mdünnak be vai jah hlüei bawk khai ni?<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Avana phäha Pamhnama mpyeneinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ka püie aw, hina khyü ngthup hin nami ksing vai yü na veng. Namimät nami kthemkia käh nami ngai khaia, Khyangmjükceea kcün am a kümkawi law hama küt üng, Isarelea mlung nglangnak cun asäng ni. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Hesa 59:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:21">21</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acukba Isarele naw küikyannak yah khaie; Cangcim üng, “Zion mcung üngka naw jah küikyanki Bawipa pha law lü Pamhnam am ami ksingnak cun Jakopa mjükphyüi üngkhyüh jah mkhyüh law pet khai.”<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:9">Hesa 27:9</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>“Ami mkhyekatnake ka jah mhlät law pet üng, acun cun ami veia ka khyütam vaia kyaki” tia pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Thangkdaw ami maha phäh, nangmia phäha Pamhnama yeea kyakie. Pamhnama a jah xünnak üng ta ami pupaea phäh Pamhnama püia kyakie. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Dawnak jah pe lü a jah xüa khana Pamhnam naw a mlung am thunghlai kawi. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Ahlana Pamhnama ngthu am nami ngai khawiki, cunsepi, tuhkbäih cun Judahe naw ngthu am ami ngaih phäha mpyeneinak nami yahki. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Acukba kunga, tuhkbäih cun Pamhnam naw ning jah mpyenei se mpyeneinak nami yahnak hnga vaia, Judahe naw pi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avanga caup üng am ve</char><char style="fq" closed="false">tuha.</char></note>Pamhnama mpyeneinak ami yahnak bawk hnga vaia Pamhnama ngthu am ngai u. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Pamhnam naw khyang naküt a jah mpyeneinak thei vaia khyang naküt cun ngthu am ngaihnak üng a jah tak päiha kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnam mhlünmtainak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Hesa 55:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pamhnama kthemnak ja ksingkhyapnak cun a aktäa ngsawngkang ve. A ngthumkhyahnake cun jah ksing thei vaia am kya lü u naw a tüilame pi ksing khai ni. <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Hesa 40:13</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Cangcim naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“U naw Bawipaa mlung cun ksingki ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">U naw Pamhnam mtheimthang khawiki ni.<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Job 41:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A thung be vaia pi u naw i pe khawiki ni?<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Kor 8:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Avan naküt cun amät naw mhnünmcengki. Anaküt cun amät üngkhyüh ngtüi law lü amäta phäha kyaki. Pamhnam hlüngtainak aläa ve se. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama khutbi üng xünseinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Acunakyase, ka püie aw, Pamhnama dämduhkia mpyeneinak am ning jah nghuinak ta, nami mät kung cän Pamhnama veia xüngseikia ngkengnaka mäia ng’apei lü Pamhnama khut bi ua. Acuna khut nami binak naw Pamhnam jesaki ni. Ahin cun akcanga nami pet vaia hjawkhahnak ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Hin khawmdeka thuma käh ve u lü, Pamhnam naw akthaia nami mlung ning jah thunghlai se. Acun üngva Pamhnama ngjakhlü akdaw i ti ja ani cun kümkawikia jenaksak hin i tia nami ksing khai.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Pamhnam naw amdanga a na peta a bäkhäknaka phäha nangmi üng u naw pi a vea kthaka hlüng khai käh ngai ua ti veng. Acuna kthaka ta aknema ngai u lü Pamhnam naw a ning jah peta jumnaka kba nami mät ngaiei ua. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4,5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1Kor 12:12</ref></char></note>Pumsa mat üng ngban khawhah mi taki, mi ngbane naküt a ami bilawh am täng u. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Acukba kunga mimi khawjah mi law sepi Khritaw üng mtisa mata mi kyaki; lüpi mimi cun mi nghngalang lüpi mat ja mat mtisa mat üng mi ngsuki. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1Kor 12:4-11</ref></char></note> A bäkhäknak am a jah pet mi khyaihnak phäh phäh üng khut mi bi vai u. Pamhnama ngthu pyennak vai a jah pet üng ta jumnak mi taka kba mi pyen vai u. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Khüibi bi khaia akya üng khüibi mi bi vai u; mtheiki naw pi mtheinak mi bi vai u; <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>khyang ngjuktha peki naw pi ngjuktha petnak bi se; petmsawtki naw pi käh pam lü pe se; ana mah naw pi ktha na lü bilo se; khyang mpyeneiki naw pi jekyainak am mpyenei se.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Mhläkphyanak cun mhläkphyanak kcanga kyase. Mkhyekatnak hneng u lü dawnak kpang ua. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Khritjanea nami kya kba mat ja mat hnün ata kba mhläkphya na u lü ngkhawtei ua. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Khüinak lam üng käh dam u lü; mlungkyawng ap lü Bawipa khut bi ua, <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>äpeinak üng jekyai u lü; khuikha khameinak cun cunei u lü, angläta ktaiyü ua. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>A hlükaw veki khritjane üng jah petmsawt u lü; khine pi nami jah khinnak vai.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mt 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Lk 6:28</ref></char>
    </note>Ning jah mkhuimkhakie, dawkyanak am jah kbe u; käh jah yünce u lü dawkyanak nami ja kbe vai. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Jekie jah jepüi u lü; kyapkie jah kyahpüi u. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Ngthk 3:7</ref></char></note>Ngaihnak thei avana khana atäng ta ua. Käh awhcah u. Mlung nemnak üng dokham ua. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mdihmsuia mtae cun do lü; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">mlung mhnemki khyange am ngpüiei u.</char></note>Themkia namimät käh ngai ua.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Khyang naw a ning hmakatsak üngpi käh thungei be u. Khyang avan naw daw khaia ngaih cän pawh a. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Khyang naküt am nami ngkhawt vaia anaküt cän bi a. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Deut 32:35</ref></char></note>Ka püie aw, u pi käh thungei be u, Pamhnama naw thung be se, “Phu naküt cun keia thung vaia kyaki, kei naw thung be lü kei naw ka pe bekhai ti lü Bawipa naw” Cangcim üng a ti. <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Ngthk 25:21</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref> (LXX)</char></note>Acunakyase, na ye a ei a cawi üng, a ei vai pea, tui a xai üng a awk vai pea; acukba na bi üngva ngkekhyakei khaie ni. <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Akse naw käh ning jah näng lü akdaw am akse cän näng ua.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Khawngmange veia bi vai mta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Khyang naküt naw jah upki khawngmanga pyen cun ngai kawm, isetiakyaküng Pamhnam naw ana a jah peta phäha khawngmange cun vekie. Pamhnama jah mcawna kyakie ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Acunakyase, u pi, khawngmang am kcangnaki cun Pamhnama mcawn ksekha nakia kyase; amäta khana ngthumkhyahnak yah khai. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Akdaw pawhki naw jah upkie cun jah kyüh vai am ni. Lüpi akse pawhkie naw ami jah kyüh vai ni. Am na jah kyüh vai na tängki aw? Akdaw na pawh ta ning mküiei khaie; <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>isetiakyaküng amimi cun Pamhnama mpyaea kya lü nanga phäh akdaw pawh khaie ni. Cunsepi, akse na pawh üng jah kyüh a, amimia mkhuimkhanak khawha ana cun akcang ni, isetiakyaküng jah mkhuimkha khaie ni. Akse pawhkie khana Pamhnama mkhuimkhanak cun biloki Pamhnama mpyaea kyakie ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnama mkhuimkhanak na kyüh däka phäh am kya lü namäta ksingeinaka phäha ana takie mtheha vea.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6,7:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mt 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mk 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Lk 20:25</ref></char>
    </note>Acunakyase ni, ngcawn pi na ngcawng ta; isetiakyaküng jah upkie cun naw ami mta ami bi hin Pamhnama phäh khüikie ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Na pet vai mta cun jah pe a. Namäta phäh ja na khawhthema phäh ngcawng cun pe lü jah leisawng kawmki.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mat ja mata khana bi vai mta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Mata veia pi käh lei mah lü mat ja mat nami mhläkphyanaka thea ta i käh lei na ua. Ahin pawhki naw ta Thum kcangnaki ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Ex 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Deut 5:18</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ex 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deut 5:17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:15">Ex 20:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19">Deut 5:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Ex 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Deut 5:21</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">e</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char></note>Thum naw, “Khyanga khyu, khyanga cei käh na bäühmanak vai; khyang käh na hnim vai; käh na mpyuk vai; khyanga ka käh na hlükawei vai” a ti. Ahin avan ja akce ngthupet naküt cun, “Namät na mhläkphyanaka kba na impei loceng na mhläkphyanak vai” tia ngthupet mat üng kümkawi päihkie. <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Khyang kce na mhläkphyanak üng amimi khana akse am pawhki, mhläkphyanak na tak cun Thum avan na kcangnak ni.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Nami ihnak üngkhyüh nami thüxak vai akcün pha lawkia kyase hin hin pawh ua. Isetiakyaküng küikyannak hin akcüka mi jumeia kcüna kthaka ng’et law bawki ni. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Mthan päih law hlü hnüh lü, khaw thai law hlü ve; acunakyase, nghmüp üng mi bilawhe mi jah hawih u lü, akvaia üng ngtuknaka likcime mi jah kawtei vai u. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Mhnüpa vekie khyangea kba akdawa mi ve vai u. Eiawknak, ju mpyüinak, aksea ngneisak, ngtunngvawknak, hüipawmnak ja ng’eiknak üng käh mi ve vai u. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa likcim cun kawtei u lü nami mtisaa ngjakhlüa mkhyekatnak cän käh pawh ua.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Khyangkce ngthu käh mkhya vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Acunüng, a jumeinak ktha ngcekie jah dokham lü ami cungaihnak käh jah ngcuhpüi ua. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Khyang avanga jumeinak naw avan eia nglawiki tia ngai lüpi a jumeinak ngceki naw ta an däk eiki. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Avan eiki naw avan am eiki käh hmumsit kawm; avan am eiki naw pi avan eiki käh pyenei kawm; Pamhnam naw ani nghngih jah dokhamki ni. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Khyang kcea mpyae ngthumkhyah khai cun nang u ni? A ngnäng vai ja am a ngnäng vai cun a Mahpa naw mkhyah khai ni. Ani nghngih ngnäng khai xawi, isetiakyaküng Bawipa naw jah ngnängsak khawhki. <verse eid="ROM 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Khyang avang naw khaw mhnüp at cun akce mhnüpea kthaka dawkia ngai lü, khyang kce naw khaw mhnüp avan tängkia ngaiki. Mi mlung mi nängei kawm u. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Khaw mhnüp ak’hlüng säiha ngaiki naw pi Bawipa leisawng kawm. Anaküt eiki naw pi Bawipa leisawng lü Pamhnam üng eiawka phäh jenak mtheh kawm. Anaküt am eiawki naw pi Bawipa leisawng lü Pamhnam üng jenak mtheh kawm. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>A u pi, mimäta phäha mi xüngkia am kya, mimäta phäha mi thihkia pi am kya. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Mi xün üng Bawipa phäha mi xüng u lü, mi thih üng pi Bawipa phäha mi thiki; acunakyase, mi xüng üng pi, mi thih üng pi kyase Bawipa kaa mi kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Khritaw thi lü a thawhnak be cun akxüng he ja akthihe phäha Bawipa a thawn vaia phäh kyaki. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kor 5:10</ref></char></note>Cunakyase, an eikia na kyak üng i vai akce ngthu na mkhyah petki ni? Nang naw avan na ei üngpi ivai jumeiki akce na hmumsitki ni? Avan cun ngthumkhyahnak khamei vaia Pamhnama ma mi ngdüi law khai. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Hesa 45:23</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Cangcim üng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Kei xüngkia Pamhnam ni ti lü Bawipa naw pyenki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">khyang naküt ka ma mkhuk msüm u lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">khyang naküt naw kei cun Pamhnam ni ti khaie” tia pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Acunakyase, mi van naw mi bi naküta phäh Pamhnama veia mi phyeh law khaie.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyangkce käh na kyukngtängsak vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Khyang üng ngthu mi mkhya pet cän mi hawih kawm u. Acuna kthaka anaküt ami pawh üng akce käh nami kyukngtängsak vaia mcei ua. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Bawipa Jesuh üng ka vekia kyase ei vai naküt hin ngcim ve. Lüpi eiawk avang hin am ngcim ve tia na jum üngta na phäh am ngcim ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>I mä na eia phäh akcea am adawnak ani üngta na vecawh hin mhläkphyanak üngkhyüh am ni. Khritaw a phäha thiki khyang cun na eiawk üng käh kyukngtängsaka. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Akdawa na ngaih cun naw ngming kse na yahnak vaia käh kyase. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Pamhnama Pe cun eiawknak üng am kya. Lüpi Ngmüimkhya Ngcima a jah peta ngsungpyunnak, dim’yenak ja jekyainak üng ni akya ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Ahina tuilam üng Khritawa phäh na bi üng Pamhnam jesaki lü khyang kcee naw pi ni mküiei khaie ni.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Acunakyase, dim’yenak ja mat ja mat ngjuktha jah pe khaiea ngkaw cän angläta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Angläta mi bü yahki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">angläta mi büki.</char></note>jah bilo ua. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Eiawk üng Pamhnama khüibi käh na kpyeh vai. Eiawk naküt ei lü ngcimki cunsepi khyang mkhyenak üng a kyukngtäng vaia na eiawk cun am daw ve. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Jumeiki khyang kce kyukngtängsak khaia meh einak ja ju awknak cun hjawng hin dawki ni. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Hina mawng üng na jumnak cun Pamhnam ja namäta nglaka ve kawm. Ami bilawh üng mkhyekatnaka am kya tia ngaikie cun ami ngaihnak cangkie cun je u se. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Cunsepi mlung uplatnak ta lü ami eia khana Pamhnam naw jah mkatei, isetiakyaküng, jumnak üng am ami bilawha phäha kyaki. Jumnak üng am tünei cun mkhyekatnaka kyaki.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Khyang jesak vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Acunakyase, mi jumnak üng mi dämkie naw, mimäta dawnak däk käh mi sui u lü, kthangcekiea phüih pi mi jah phüihpüi vai u. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Jumeiki khyang kceea kyäpnak vai ja ami dawnak vai mi teng u lü jumnak üng mi jah sawngsa vai u. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Khritaw naw pi amäta a dawnak vai am sui, “Nang ni ksenakiea ksenak cun, keia khana kya lawki” tia Cangcim üng ng’yuki. <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Cangcim üng vekie cun, mimi naw mlungsaünak ja mlungüpnak üngkhyüh äpeinak mi yah vaia acune naw jah mthei khaia ng’yukie ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Nangmi cun mlungmsaünak ja mlungüpnaka phungnu Pamhnam naw mlungkaw mat am Khritaw Jesuha ngneisaka kba nami xüngsei khaia, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa Pa ja Pamhnam cun a yüma mlungkaw mat am nami mküimto khaie ni.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khyangmjükcee veia thangkdaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Khritaw naw a ning jah dokhama kba Pamhnama hlüngtainak vaia mat ja mat dokhamei ua. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Ning jah mtheh veng, Khritawa sak üng a bilawh hin Judahea phäh kya lü Pamhnam hin sitihki. Ami pupaea veia a jah peta khyütam cun akcanga kümkawi lawsaki, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Sam 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Sal 18:49</ref> </char></note> Khyangmjükcee naw Pamhnama mpyeneinak mhlünmtai law khawh khaie. Acunakyase, Cangcim üng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Acunakyase, Khyangmjükceea ksunga ning mhlünmtai lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">mküimtonak ng’äi ka mcuk khai” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Deut 32:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A pyen be tü ta, “Khyangmjükcee aw Pamhnama khyange am atänga jekyai ua” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sal 117:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acun käna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Khyangmjükce naküt naw Bawipa mküimto ua, khyang avan naw mküimto ua” a ti.<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Hesa 11:10</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Acun käna Hesajah naw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Jisea ngsawn po law khai, ani Khyangmjükcee jah uk law khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ani üng äpeinak ta law khaie.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Ngmüimkhya Ngcima johit am nami äpeinak adäm law vaia Pamhnam nami jumnak üng äpeinaka phungnu Pamhnam naw jekyainak ja dimdeihnak üng ning jah kbe se.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh naw ling lü a yuka mawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Acunüng, ka püie aw, dawkyanak am bebang u lü, avan nami ksingkia kyase, mat ja mat mtheimkhawngei ua. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Cunsepi, Pamhnam naw bäkhäknak a na pet cun ling lü, avan üng ka ning jah mtheh hlü be tüa phäh ka ning jah yuk law ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Acun cun, Khyangmjükceea veia Pamhnam üngka thangkdaw cun ktaiyüa nghnün üng pyen veng, Khritaw Jesuha khut bikia ka kyanak vaia kyaki; Ngmüikhya Ngcim naw Khyangmjükceea bilawh cun Pamhnama phäha ngcimsaki ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Acunakyase, Khritaw Jesuh am yüm mat lü Pamhnama khut bi hin ka awcahnak vai veki. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Khritaw naw kei üngkhyüh khut bi lü khyangmjükcee jah cehpüi lü Pamhnama pyen ami ngjak vaia mawng däk ni lingnak am ka pyen. Ahin cun ngthu ja khutbinak am pi kyase, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>müncamkse ja cäicatnake am pi kyase, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya johit üng pi kyase acun am ni a bilawh. Jerusalem üngkhyüh Ilurihkon däa cit hü lü Khritawa mawng Thangkdaw ka sang hüki <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Acukba, khyang kce naw a süma lung khana, lung am mdün veng. Khritawa ngming am ami ngjaknak hama hnüna thangkdaw ka sang hü vaia ni ka bü. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Hesa 52:15</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Acuna mäiha Cangcim üng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Ngthu am ngja khawikie naw hmu u lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">am ngja khawikie naw ksing khaie” tia pyenki.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Romaha cit khaia ngtünki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom 1:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Acunakyase, nami veia am ka law thei khaia na khamki veki ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Tuhkbäih cun hina khaw üngka khüinak ka kpäng ni, kum khawvei nami veia ka law khaia ka ngtün pängkia pi kyase, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Spaina ka ceh naküt üng ka ceh lama ka ning ja hmu law pah khaia ngai veng; nami veia law lü ka jekyai käna, ka cehnak thei vaia nami na kpüi khaia ngai veng. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1Kor 16:1-4</ref></char></note> Tuhkbäih cun Pamhnama khyange ka jah khüih khaia, Jerusalem mlüha ka cit ma khaia kya ve. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Isetiakyaküng, Maketawniha hne ja Akaijah hnea sangcime naw Jerusalem mlüha veki Pamhnama khyange ksunga mpyenksekiea phäh petmsawtnak am jah kuei vaia mkhyahkie. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Kor 9:11</ref></char></note> Amimi jah kuei vaia amimäte naw mkhyahki ni; Judahe naw Khyangmjükcee cun ngmüimkhya lam ami jah yümpüi üng, khawmdek khawhthem am ami jah kuei be vai cun ami mta kung ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Acunakyase, acuna khut cun kpäng lü, ngui jah mhjum lü Spaina ka ceh sawa ka ning jah hmu law pah khai. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Acunüng, nami veia ka law üng Khritawa dawkyanak am bebang lü ka law khai tia ka ksingki.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ka püie aw, ka phäha Pamhnama vei angläta nami na ktaiyüpüi vaia mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw ja Ngmüimkhya a jah pet mhläkphyanak am ning jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Am jumeikie Judahea ksunga Pamhnam naw a na yung vai ja Jerusalema ka bilawhe Pamhnama khyange naw ami dokham khawh vaia na ktaiyü pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Pamhnam naw hlüei üng ta jekyainak am ka law khai, ka lawnak vai cun atänga ktha mi yahnak vai ni. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Dimyenaka phung Pamhnam naw ning ja ve püi nglät se. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kenkirih mlüh sangcim üng khut pawhki, kami ci Phobe naw ning ja ksingsak veng. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Pamhnama khyange nami jah mceia kba Bawipaa ngming üng jah dokham ua. Kpüi vai a hlü naküt üng kpüi u. Ani cun khyang khawjah a jah püinak kba kei pi na püinaki.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Ngs 18:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Atänga Khritaw Jesuha khut kami bikia Priscilah ja Akuilah na jah hnukset pe ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Acun xawi naw ka phäha ami sak am mceh na ni. Bäki xawi tia kei däk naw ka pyenkia am kya, Khyangmjükce sangcime naw pi tikie ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Ami ima ngbämkie sangcime pi na ja hnukset pe ua. Asah hnea Khritaw jumei law kcükia ka mhlänak ka püi, Ephamit pi na hnukset pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Marih nami phäha ktha na lü khüiki cän na hnukset pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Ka mjü Judah khyang Andronikah ja Junih, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:7:</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Junia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Junias; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng veki</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Julia.</char></note>thawngim üng ka jah kyumpüi xawi pi na ja hnukset pet ua; anini cun ngsä he üng ami ngming aktäa ngthangki xawia kya ni lü, keia kthaka khritaw üng ve maki xawia kyaki xawi ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Ka püi, Ampalih, Bawipa üng ka ngkhawt püi cän na hnukset pe ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Khritaw üng khutbi kami bipüi Uraban ja ka mhlänaka Satakah cän na hnukset pe ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Khritaw üng sitih cangkia Apelih cän na hnukset pet ua. Aristobuluha khyang lawng üngkae pi na jah hnukset pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ka Judah khyang püi, Erodung cän na hnukset pe ua. Nakituha khyang lawng üng Bawipa üng vekie cän na jah hnukset pet ua.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Tarupenah ja Taruphotah, Bawipa üng khüi khawiki xawi cen na ja hnukset pe u. Ka mhlänak Peratih, Bawipa üng aktä leng leng se khüiki pi na jah hnukset pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mk 15:21</ref></char></note> Bawipa a jah xü Rufuh ja a nu, a na ca akba na ve püiki pi na jah hnukset pet u. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asukrit, Phalekung, Hames, Patrobah, Hamas ja, ami veia vekie cen na jah hnukset pet ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Philolokung ja Juli, Niruh ja a na, Olampat ja ami hlawng veki Pamhnama khyange cän na jah hnukset pet ua.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Ngcimkia hnuksetnak üng hnuksetei ua. Khritawa sangcime naküt naw ning jah hnukset ve u.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apäihnaka mcäinake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Acunüng, ka püie aw, ngtainak pawhkie ja khyanga jumeinak helatsakie cän mceiei u lü, nami yaha mtheimthangnak ning jah hawih hlüsakie nami jah nghlat tak vaia ning jah mtheh veng.<verse eid="ROM 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Acuna mäihe naw mi Bawipa Khritawa khutbi am bi u lü amimäta khawnua phäha khutbikie ni; khyü ktui ja mhläknak ngthu am khyang ngcime jah mhleimhlakie ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Thangkdaw üng nami khäng cun khyang naküta vei a ngthang hüa phäh jekyai veng. Akdaw lama them u lü akse lama pi ngcim ua. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Dim’yenaka phungnu Pamhnam naw Khawyam cun nami khawa keha mhnüi law khai. Mi Bawipa Jesuha bäkhäknak nami veia ve se.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">avang yuknake üng cayüi am ve.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Ngs 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka khüipüi Timoti, Lucia, Jason, ka Judah khyang püi, Sotihpetae naw ning jah hnukset ve u.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Hina ca yukia, kei Teratih naw, Bawipa ngming am ning jah hnukset veng.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ngs 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Kor 1:14</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2Tim 4:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sangcimea ngkhyumnak im, na khinnaki Kajas naw ning jah hnukset ve. Mlüha khawh sämkia Eratuh ja nami na Kawtuh naw ning jah hnukset ve.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Avang yuknake naw ami kpüi akdik 24: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nangmi üng ve se. Amen; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akcee naw akdik 27 käna ami kpüi</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nami khana ve se. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka mhlünmtai lü ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Pamhnam üng hlüngtainak ve se! Ani naw nami jumeinak ning jah khängsak khawhki ni, acuna thangkdaw cun keia sang Jesuh Khritawa mawng, ajana kcün üng ngthup khawikia ngthungtak mdannak ni. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Sahmaea cauke naw ngthungtak cun angsinga mdan law lü angläta xüngki Pamhnama ngthupet üngkhyüha khyangmjü naküta veia jah ksingsak lü avan naw jum lü ami kcangnak vaia phäh ni.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Pamhnam amät däk avan ksingnak am bebang lü, Jesuh Khritaw üng angläta hlüngtainak be se. Amen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akdike 25-27 cun hia avang yuknake naw ta u lü 14.23 käna; 14.23 käna akcee üng ve lü; 15.33 käna akce naw ami tak u</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
